[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12300.55, "timestamp": "03:25:00", "text": "嗨"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12302.95, "timestamp": "03:25:02", "text": "感谢所有在两个时间都来过的人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12305.75, "timestamp": "03:25:05", "text": "Twitch 和 YouTube。我深感抱歉。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12308.55, "timestamp": "03:25:08", "text": "我意识到问题出在你身上了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12314.63, "timestamp": "03:25:14", "text": "抽搐。那是因为……嗯，我的……嗯……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12317.11, "timestamp": "03:25:17", "text": "我目前正在使用第二个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12319.269, "timestamp": "03:25:19", "text": "多目标引擎的插件，它有点像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12322.87, "timestamp": "03:25:22", "text": "现在很流行，因为……嗯，是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12325.91, "timestamp": "03:25:25", "text": "明白了，它有垂直画布功能。所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12328.79, "timestamp": "03:25:28", "text": "是的。嗯，我以前用的插件是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12332.87, "timestamp": "03:25:32", "text": "多房间直播到 Twitch 平台"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12334.79, "timestamp": "03:25:34", "text": "我正在使用的新插件"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12337.429, "timestamp": "03:25:37", "text": "同时还在Twitch上进行了直播。所以这就是原因"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12339.51, "timestamp": "03:25:39", "text": "这两个连接都相互干扰"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12342.87, "timestamp": "03:25:42", "text": "彼此。这就是原因。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12344.79, "timestamp": "03:25:44", "text": "但是，呃，我对那些……感到抱歉"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12347.11, "timestamp": "03:25:47", "text": "在Twitch上观看。我知道V必须"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12349.75, "timestamp": "03:25:49", "text": "已经被腐蚀或搞砸了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12351.91, "timestamp": "03:25:51", "text": "现在。但没关系。你可以观看V"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12354.95, "timestamp": "03:25:54", "text": "在 YouTube 上。好的。或者如果你在比利"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12357.429, "timestamp": "03:25:57", "text": "Willy，你可以观看翻译后的V。"}]